    title: "Phase 3 coverage-directed selection: allow NARROWING, opt-in, never default (precondition: unmeasured tests still selected)"  # 6b2a
    status: todo_soft  # 6b2a
    priority: 4  # 6b2a
    parent:  # 6b2a
